  "body": "In ReadableStreamClose() we iterate over default reader's readRequests to resolve all of their promises.  We don't, however, do this for BYOB reader readIntoRequests.  Is this intentional?\n\nNote that we do iterate and reject BYOB reader readIntoRequests in ReadableStreamError().\n",
